{
    "name": "札札弄机杼",
    "category": "tfg:agriculture",
    "icon": "tfc:spindle",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(thing)织布$()是把不同种类的线合成$(thing)布料$()的过程。虽然织布的最后一步是在$(thing)织布机$()上完成的，但有些布料，比如$(thing)羊毛$()——从$(l:agriculture/animal_husbandry#wooly_animals)产毛动物$()身上获得——需要先用$(thing)纺锤$()纺出$(thing)羊毛纱$()才能织。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
            "recipe": "tfc:clay_knapping/spindle_head",
            "anchor": "spindle",
            "text": "$(thing)未烧制的纺锤头$()用黏土塑形而成，随后可以$(l:game_mechanics/heating)烧制$()成$(thing)纺锤头$()。把它和$(thing)木棍$()合成，就得到了完整的纺锤。纺锤也可以用$(l:craftsmanship/metallurgy)金属$()制作。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "anchor": "spinning",
            "title": "纺纱",
            "recipe": "tfc:kjs/damage/shapeless/wool_yarn",
            "text": "将$(thing)羊毛$()与纺锤合成，得到$(thing)羊毛纱$()。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "title": "织布机",
            "anchor": "loom",
            "recipe": "tfc:crafting/wood/acacia_loom",
            "text": "可以用$(thing)木材$()和$(thing)木棍$()制作织机。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:loom_recipe",
            "anchor": "wool_cloth",
            "title": "布料",
            "recipe": "tfc:loom/wool_cloth",
            "text": "每 16 卷$(thing)羊毛纱$()能够织成一匹$(thing)羊毛布$()。首先，手持羊毛纱对准织机按$(item)$(k:key.use)$()。接着持续$(item)$(k:key.use)$()点击织机。待织机处理完整匹毛布后再次按$(item)$(k:key.use)$()就可以取下布匹了。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/loom_empty.png",
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/loom_full.png",
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/loom_working.png",
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/loom_done.png"
            ],
            "text": "织机织布的几个不同阶段。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:relations",
            "title": "延伸阅读",
            "anchor": "relations",
            "entries": [
                "tfg:agriculture/growing_crops",
                "tfg:agriculture/animal_husbandry",
                "tfg:the_world/wild_crops",
                "tfg:the_world/wild_animals",
                "tfg:craftsmanship/pottery",
                "tfg:craftsmanship/glassworking"
            ]
        }
    ],
    "read_by_default": true,
